From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] pmdomain: airoha: allow board opt-in to direct CPU PLL

The existing fallback only uses direct PLL programming if BL31 does not
respond. XG2010G has a working but 1.2 GHz-limited AVS service. Let its
board DTS explicitly choose the direct PLL path while other boards retain
their original SMC behavior. Reject out-of-range performance states before
calculating a PLL setting.

This is an experimental overclocking path and requires board validation.
---
--- a/drivers/pmdomain/mediatek/airoha-cpu-pmdomain.c
+++ b/drivers/pmdomain/mediatek/airoha-cpu-pmdomain.c
@@ -127,6 +127,9 @@ static int airoha_cpu_pll_set_freq(struct
 	unsigned long flags;
 	u32 val, old_chg, cleared;
 
+	if (state > 22)
+		return -EINVAL;
+
 	if (freq_mhz < 1000) {
 		posdiv = 1;
 		pcw_int = freq_mhz / 25;
@@ -229,7 +232,8 @@ static int airoha_cpu_pmdomain_probe(str
 	if (!priv)
 		return -ENOMEM;
 
-	if (airoha_cpu_smc_available()) {
+	if (!of_property_read_bool(dev->of_node, "airoha,force-direct-pll") &&
+	    airoha_cpu_smc_available()) {
 		priv->use_smc = true;
 		dev_info(dev, "using ATF SMC for CPU frequency control\n");
 	} else {
@@ -245,7 +249,7 @@ static int airoha_cpu_pmdomain_probe(str
 			return dev_err_probe(dev, PTR_ERR(priv->mcucfg),
 					     "ATF SMC not available and no mcucfg reg in DT\n");
 
-		dev_info(dev, "ATF SMC not available, using direct PLL programming\n");
+		dev_info(dev, "using direct PLL programming for CPU frequency control\n");
 	}
 
 	priv->hw.init = &init;
